        "original_id": "e6a44c17-6698-5301-a5d2-ea074d0f6f63",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Karaar, Galgale Nighale\n- People: Manoj Kotian, Subodh Bhave, Urmila Kothare, Kranti Redkar, Suhasini Mule, Aarti More, Avdhoot Gupte, Shreya Ghoshal, Bela Shende, Sonu Kakkar, Jasraj Joshi, Neha Rajpal, Vaishali Samant, Anand Shinde\n- Roles: director, actor, singer, music composer, lyricist, playback singer\n- Topics: Marathi film and music industry, film songs\n\nFacts:\n- Manoj Kotian directed the Marathi feature film Karaar.\n- Subodh Bhave, Urmila Kothare, Kranti Redkar, Suhasini Mule, and Aarti More starred in Karaar.\n- Avdhoot Gupte, Shreya Ghoshal, Bela Shende, Sonu Kakkar, Jasraj Joshi, Neha Rajpal, and Vaishali Samant sang songs for Karaar.\n- Vaishali Samant is an Indian music composer, lyricist, and playback singer known for her work in the Marathi film and music industry.\n- Gori Gauri Mandavakhali is a superhit song from the film Galgale Nighale.\n- Vaishali Samant and Anand Shinde sang Gori Gauri Mandavakhali.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
